    {
      "id": "2589cc96ec585e1eba8ef47de06e4576fa775000",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3017408170,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> Export PDUs to file closes the current capture file and opens the exported file instead\n\nIt does? If so, that's a bug - \"Save As...\" should do that, and does, but \"Export Selected PDUs...\" specifically means \"save a subset of packets to another file, do *not* overwrite the currently open file\", and *shouldn't* reopen the file with the exported file.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-01-19T15:12:36.297Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-01-19T15:12:36.297Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 447530287,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23285,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44b09600ae483044c2d77c75609d1c3c568831d1",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3017444069,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, \"Export PDUs to File\" has different behavior than \"Export Specified Packets.\"\n\nIt does not overwrite the currently open file, but it does write the exported PDUs to a temporary file, closes the currently open file, and opens the temporary file. This is quite different from \"Export Specified Packets,\" which opens a dialog asking for a name for the exported file, writes to that, and does not open it.\n\nIt would also make sense for the two different options to have the same behavior.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-01-19T15:24:34.309Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-01-19T15:24:34.309Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 447530287,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23285,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f32521aa7f278d33878968cf2abc881f395cd4dc",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3017549801,
          "type": null,
          "body": "It is, however, often more difficult to determine which and how many PDUs will be exported with Export PDUs, as opposed to Export Specified Packets, which may be a reason for the behavior.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-01-19T16:00:00.287Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-01-19T16:00:00.287Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 447530287,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23285,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bb192e6662bbe008bc63e708eb5623d3d1c66cac",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3017683306,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> It would also make sense for the two different options to have the same behavior.\n\nI.e., \"Export PDUs to File\" should also not open the file to which the packets were exported? Export Specified Packets was specifically created to work that way; see ae7d57d5fa1762e21a8e70be0bf0876f334b893c, 1d41075db164add7546d83517651a224e80835ca , and c2bb7956c234af4babe33f84628dff9e869ba2e0.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-01-19T16:54:14.663Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-01-19T16:54:14.663Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 447530287,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 23285,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8344b3f6576985d5018244e18c76bcc6e3c668f2",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3017689738,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, that is the way I would prefer to resolve it if the two options were to be the same. Export PDUs to File has also long been the way it is but I don't know how much consideration went into that.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
