      "title": "Qt: Ask before exporting PDUs if there are unsaved frames",
      "message": "Qt: Ask before exporting PDUs if there are unsaved frames\n\nExport PDUs to file closes the current capture file and opens the\nexported file instead, so do our normal test for unsaved frames.\n\nFix #20954\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
